# Skills: Security

Purpose:
  Security skills for SDDRA system. Defines security testing,
  scanning, and compliance requirements.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @testing.sdd

Rules:
  [S1] All code MUST pass security scans before merge.
  [S2] All dependencies MUST be scanned for vulnerabilities.
  [S3] No secrets allowed in code.
  [S4] All security issues MUST be resolved before deployment.
  [S5] Security testing is mandatory before production.

Navigation:
  Testing: @testing.sdd

State: +
